    "detailed_description": "This is a small Puzzle Platformer where you dynamically scaling through the game. <br>You can precisely move around, get blocked everywhere;<br>Or become giant but bulky, destroy obstacles with your body weight.<br>Chain the advantages of different sizes to clear the level!<br><br>Mechanics:<br>\u5de8 (Gigantify):<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/9351416778a0184c5502896f9249834e.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>This will make you big for 5 seconds.<br>You will have all sorts of power, but to go anywhere,<br>You'll have to build up speed beforehand.<br><br>Solid Brick:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/b4c653b48fef6eb17fc21c695fdd94b8.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>It's solid. There is no way to break it.<br>There are some fake ones with the same texture though.<br><br>Breakable Brick:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/13ea68bf0437784600be8a27f31e02e6.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>If you are big, this can be broken.<br>Otherwise it will block you when you're small.<br><br>Spring:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/c8c9eb0edd0515f9653055a7a417691c.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>When you're big, you can compress them;<br>If you are small and tough the compressed spring,<br>It will release and give you a huge amount of velocity.<br><br>There are 6 levels, each has 2 exits while 1 hidden somewhere.<br>Find each one of them for...nothing.<br>Have fun!",
    "about_the_game": "This is a small Puzzle Platformer where you dynamically scaling through the game. <br>You can precisely move around, get blocked everywhere;<br>Or become giant but bulky, destroy obstacles with your body weight.<br>Chain the advantages of different sizes to clear the level!<br><br>Mechanics:<br>\u5de8 (Gigantify):<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/9351416778a0184c5502896f9249834e.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>This will make you big for 5 seconds.<br>You will have all sorts of power, but to go anywhere,<br>You'll have to build up speed beforehand.<br><br>Solid Brick:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/b4c653b48fef6eb17fc21c695fdd94b8.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>It's solid. There is no way to break it.<br>There are some fake ones with the same texture though.<br><br>Breakable Brick:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/13ea68bf0437784600be8a27f31e02e6.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>If you are big, this can be broken.<br>Otherwise it will block you when you're small.<br><br>Spring:<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1858580/extras/c8c9eb0edd0515f9653055a7a417691c.avif?t=1643158560\" /></div><br>When you're big, you can compress them;<br>If you are small and tough the compressed spring,<br>It will release and give you a huge amount of velocity.<br><br>There are 6 levels, each has 2 exits while 1 hidden somewhere.<br>Find each one of them for...nothing.<br>Have fun!",
